      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 2004, business owners led by Diane Coward of Fuel Cafe and Stacey Matney of PIE Footwear formed the Alberta Business Association to market the street.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
